<mxCell id="c1" value="&lt;b&gt;AgriVision pipeline: fuse images first, NDVI last&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1500" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
